<title>UK: Bradford &amp; Bingley vice chairman retires.</title>
<headline>Bradford &amp; Bingley vice chairman retires.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bradford and Bingley Building Society said in a statement on Friday that vice-chairman Geoffrey Lister would retire on January 31.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
